    posBusinessCloseTourS3cTitle: 'သေတ္တာငွေနှင့် ထည့်သွင်းစုစုပေး',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3cBody:
      '**လက်ရှိသေတ္တာငွေ** နှင့် **ပေးဆောင်မှုတန်းလမ်းများ၏ စုစုပေါင်း** ကို နှိုင်းယှဉ်ပါ။ မူဝါဒအရ အဓိပ္ပါယ်ကွဲပြားပါက ဌာနချုပ်လမ်းညွှန်ချက်ကို လိုက်နာပါ—မကိုက်ညီမှုရှိပါက ပိတ်မသိမ်းမီ ရှာဖွေပါ။',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3dTitle: 'ကွာခြားချက် (ထည့်သွင်း − စနစ်)',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3dBody:
      '**ကွာခြားချက်** သုညနီးပါးဖြစ်အောင် ချိန်ညှိပါ။ ခွင့်ပြုချက်ကျော်လွန်၍လုပ်ရန်လိုအပ်ပါက နေရာတွင်အတည်ပြုပါ။',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3eTitle: 'မှတ်ချက်',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3eBody:
      'ကွာခြားချက်အကြောင်း၊ မန်နေဂျာအတည်ပြုချက် သို့ငွေသိုက်**မှတ်ချက်** မှတ်ပါ—နောက်ပိုင်းစစ်ဆေးမှုအတွက် အသုံးဝင်သည်။',
    posTourFullW19cTitle: 'Dutch pay - menu အလိုက် mode',
    posTourFullW19dBody:
      'လုပ်ဆောင်စဉ်: (1) target person ရွေး (2) menu တိုင်းအတွက် +/- ဖြင့် quantity ခွဲ (3) ထိုလူ၏ပမာဏနှင့် လက်ကျန်စစ် (4) **Partial payment** နှိပ်ပြီး နောက်လူသို့ ဆက်ပါ။',
    posTourFullW19dTitle: 'Menu-based split panel',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS1Body: 'This training follows home -> business open -> cash in/out -> business close. In demo mode, save/close actions may not write to production data.',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS1Title: 'Start practical close training',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS2Body: 'Business management is the entry for open/close settlement. Next, move to the business-open screen and practice the real input flow.',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS2Title: 'Business management entry',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS3Body: 'Cash management is where you track in/out transactions and running balance. After business-open training, continue here for register flow practice.',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS3Title: 'Cash management entry',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS4Body: 'Press Next to open the business-open screen. First practice counting and saving opening cash by denomination.',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourS4Title: 'Next: business open input',
    posBusinessCashHomeTourTitle: 'Business and cash practical tour (home)',
    posBusinessCloseTourS1Body:
      'Align payment tenders with POS system sales; then prioritize Drawer variance (denom sum − expected drawer) before sign-off.',
    posBusinessCloseTourS1Title: 'Business close screen',
    posBusinessCloseTourS2Body:
      'Fill tenders to match **system sales** totals. Physical surplus/short is checked separately in **Drawer variance**.',
    posBusinessCloseTourS2Title: 'Settlement entry area',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3Body: 'Enter actual drawer cash using denominations. In live operation, this must match physical cash.',
    posBusinessCloseTourS3Title: 'Drawer cash actual',
    posBusinessCloseTourS4Body: 'After review, turn on the close checkbox. Post-close edit permissions may be restricted by role policy.',
    posBusinessCloseTourS4Title: 'Close checkbox',
    posBusinessCloseTourS5Body: 'Save confirms close status. Completing this step finishes practical training for business and cash workflows.',
    posBusinessCloseTourS5Title: 'Save close',
    posBusinessCloseTourTitle: 'Business close tour',
    posBusinessOpenTourS1Body: 'This is business-open mode. Record drawer opening cash as the baseline amount for today.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS1Title: 'Business open screen',
    posBusinessOpenTourS2Body: 'Enter bill/coin counts by denomination and the opening total is calculated automatically. In live operations, match against real cash before save.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS2Title: 'Denomination counting',
    posBusinessOpenTourS3Body: 'Save to record business-open status. You can reopen the screen later to adjust if needed.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS3Title: 'Save business open',
    posBusinessOpenTourS4Body: 'Now move to cash management and practice in/out transaction recording.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS4Title: 'Next: cash management',
    posBusinessOpenTourTitle: 'Business open tour',
    posCashTourS1Body: 'Cash management shows transaction history and current balance together. Record each movement to avoid reconciliation gaps.',
    posCashTourS1Title: 'Cash management screen',
    posCashTourS2Body: 'Fill store, type (deposit/withdrawal), date, amount, and memo. In operations, memo reason helps end-of-day reconciliation.',
    posCashTourS2Title: 'In/out registration form',
    posCashTourS3Body: 'Save writes the transaction to the list. When till **transaction date** matches the POS close date, totals also flow into **expected drawer** on close. Offline mode stores locally first, then syncs when reconnected.',
    posCashTourS3Title: 'Save registration',
    posCashTourS4Body: 'Now move to business close and finish settlement input plus close confirmation.',
    posCashTourS4Title: 'Next: business close',
    posCashTourTitle: 'Cash management tour',
    posTourNextNavigate: 'Go to next step',
    posBusinessOpenTourS0Body: 'Confirm the **settlement date** is today, then **Refresh** to reload server data. With HQ access, use store filter and print from this row.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS0Title: 'Date and toolbar',
    posBusinessOpenTourS1aBody: '**Previous day cash** and any saved opening counts appear here—use as a sanity check against physical cash this morning.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS1aTitle: 'Previous day reference',
    posBusinessOpenTourS2bBody: 'The large **cash opening total** updates as you type. If it does not match the drawer, fix counts before saving.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS2bTitle: 'Opening total',
    posBusinessOpenTourS3bBody: 'Use **Full settlement** when you need the end-of-day close form after opening. This tour continues to **cash management** next.',
    posBusinessOpenTourS3bTitle: 'Full settlement screen',
    posTourFullW19a0Body: '**Amount-based** is fastest for even splits (per-person share). **Menu-based** allocates item quantities per person when everyone pays for what they ordered.',
    posTourFullW19a0Title: 'Dutch pay — split mode',
    posTourFullW19a1Body: 'Tap **Amount-based** to drive per-person target amounts from headcount. Best when guests split evenly.',
    posTourFullW19a1Title: 'Amount-based mode',
    posTourFullW19a2Body: 'Set **People** to the number of payers. Changing it updates per-person amounts and the paid-step counter—double-check before charging.',
    posTourFullW19a2Title: 'Headcount',
    posTourFullW19a3Body: 'Watch **current person amount**, **progress n/N**, and **entered payments vs order total**. Dutch pay only advances when these line up for the current payer.',
    posTourFullW19a3Title: 'Progress and current share',
    posTourFullW19a4Body: 'This box shows whether **entered amounts across payment tabs** match the **order total**. In Dutch pay, first match the **current person’s share**, then use **Partial payment** to move on.',
